Qwen25 R121 bootstrap-window change for GreedyBootstrapPlacement (2 regions).

Base: DaCapo 39c1fb2 (mingerfan/dacapo-modified), with or without dacapo-13file.patch
(that patch does not touch this file). The change is textually identical to
DSL/DSL_benchmark/llm_dsl/Qwen25_24Layer_R121_DSL/compiler_reference/patch_boot_window.py:
a segment after a bootstrap reserves no normalization level when rescalingFactor
equals the waterline.

pt_agent's default build (poseidon-work/platforms/aarch64-linux/results/
agent-dacapo-bootwindow-20261030/build) is this patch applied to a copy of the
39c1fb2 + 13-file source, built with the pinned poseidon-cpu Nix shell, plus a
build/pt-boot-window.json file containing {"rule": "r121"}. Apply from the DaCapo root:

    git apply DSL/DSL_agent/validation/dacapo-r121-boot-window.patch

--- a/lib/Dialect/Earth/Transforms/GreedyBootstrapPlacement.cpp
+++ b/lib/Dialect/Earth/Transforms/GreedyBootstrapPlacement.cpp
@@ -133,8 +133,11 @@
       SmallVector<uint64_t> cost(maxDepth + 1,
                                  std::numeric_limits<uint64_t>::max());
       SmallVector<int64_t> previous(maxDepth + 1, -1);
-      // A bootstrap normalized back to the waterline already consumes one
-      // level. Fresh inputs have the full initial budget.
